VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT node-slug
GOAL
  Slug lowercases and dashes.
CLAIM dash REQUIRED
  ENSURE spaces become dashes
CLAIM lower REQUIRED
  ENSURE output is lowercase
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE node test suite has no failures
VERIFY dash
  USING node.t.dash
VERIFY lower
  USING node.t.lower
VERIFY tests-green
  USING node.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
